        <briefdescription>
<para>Send this node&apos;s boot READY_n (<computeroutput>canIdReady(NODE_ID)</computeroutput>) carrying <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol_1a216b9779a18f0f2808ccef2076977c95" kindref="member">makeReadyPayload()</ref>. </para>
