        <detaileddescription>
<para>Call once at the end of the node&apos;s setup(), after its boot EVT burst. <ref refid="namespacePanelBridge" kindref="compound">PanelBridge</ref> marks the node alive, caches its version and broadcasts SYNC_REQ. Bounded retry like every other special frame (02-can-protocol.md). From then on <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol_1a3215742dd9da68b125f121c95425e2e4" kindref="member">drain()</ref> answers every SYNC_REQ with a READY flagged <ref refid="CANProtocol_8h_1a35b1db89f5a7cd60ecc21d0d1ee1646aa17785252e510dea69f48efddd3d38954" kindref="member">ReadyFlag::RESYNC</ref> (#383) — nothing for the caller to do. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
