        <name>lastNodeHealth</name>
        <qualifiedname>CANProtocol::lastNodeHealth</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The HEALTH_n payload <ref refid="namespaceCANProtocol_1aee035f550086e47e9c533b9f547687f9" kindref="member">serviceNodeStatus()</ref> last built for this node (#344). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="namespacePanelBridge" kindref="compound">PanelBridge</ref> reports it as its own node-0 <computeroutput>_NODE_STATUS</computeroutput> row. Before the first HEALTH_n (or with <computeroutput>-DNODE_HEALTH_TELEM=0</computeroutput>) it reads not-yet-seen: dieTempC DIE_TEMP_UNAVAILABLE, everything else 0 (nodeKind UNKNOWN) — the same rule the bridge applies to a node it has no HEALTH_n from. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
